---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-bord bg-atlantique text-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">San-Pédro</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface/75">
        Ville portuaire du sud-ouest ivoirien — entre Atlantique, lagune et forêts de cacao.
        Site de démonstration à vocation marketing et culturelle.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-surface/90">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-cta" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Contenu démo — non officiel
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-surface/55">Parcourir</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a class="text-surface/85 hover:text-surface" href="/">Accueil</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-surface/85 hover:text-surface" href="/decouvrir">Découvrir</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-surface/85 hover:text-surface" href="/pratiques">Pratiques</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-surface/85 hover:text-surface" href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-surface/55">Ambiance</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-surface/80">
        <li>Port &amp; commerce cacao</li>
        <li>Plages de Monogaga</li>
        <li>Marchés &amp; vie locale</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-4 text-xs text-surface/55 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-6">
      <p>© {year} Démo San-Pédro — Astro + Tailwind</p>
      <p>Pas d’avis ni de certifications inventés.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
